{"246900":["In Viscera Cleanup Detail, you step into the boots of a space-station janitor tasked with cleaning up after various horrific sci-fi horror events. Instead of machineguns and plasma-rifles, your tools are a mop and bucket. That hero left a mess, and it's up to you to deal with the aftermath.",["6bbd1e5d1fe4fa94653c5401d363156bbe05bfbe","c1dc7c902bae5b357bc013d21c8dedaaff3bf600","6e947f7f1e9de9958f20b9cf60f2f7ec4500c616","a72858af3b17f72cdfd879dd98e8f9e761cca0d7","069803bc63cf3926aa715bf2c1a3e09b25ddf9cd","55b7592da34e0f7d081482ecca5a0d1f67255870"],"RuneStorm","RuneStorm",[246900,"Viscera Cleanup Detail","capsule_616x353.jpg",1279,0,92,18122,2,0,20151023,922312,[3,152],1500000,125,85,1,2,6,0,2,20251212,null,5.0,95,44,3,0.1,149336,2,1279,1279,1000000,2000000]],"397940":["This is a story about an office clerk who tries to leave monotonous routine of life and do a book. And if he could find the time for his dream it depends on you.",["e99727406c8b14c90fc38ce92962e590b43030f8","609852bd36840168b6c103aee985e1824b4cbb24","3a55bc6ec6648761bc9a6887c046c8e8eabb8d3f","23ad015b69b33ab4cda36313fbcbaf7ce6bcd9f8","3648620362d32efb7bcf94a0d61ffdd51b1124bc"],"Snail-Ninja Studio","Snail-Ninja Studio",[397940,"No Time To Live","capsule_616x353.jpg",159,0,72,145,0,0,20150930,646316,[0,2,3],35000,0,0,2,0,1,0,0,20200113,null,0.1,null,null,null,null,142233,0,159,159,20000,50000]],"420980":["Can you survive with three women in the middle of nowhere. In this Survival, Romance Visual Novel adventure.",["b353d0ecaec031b82515da481b7403b207653582","4a44b5563617e2869ea6227586acff770ea9c1d2","e11eaf63a7ecb57fa33553191980cdb70d790bb9"],"Dharker Studios","Maid4Fun",[420980,"Army Gals","capsule_616x353.jpg",1950,0,88,217,2,0,20170417,840711,[0,2,16,102],35000,0,30,1,1,1,0,3,20240203,null,1.0,100,1,null,null,185013,2,1950,1950,20000,50000]],"505460":["Foxhole is a massively multiplayer game where thousands of players shape the outcome of a persistent online war. Every individual soldier is